# Generated cross-tool artifacts (regenerate with the harness in peers/ and arch/).
# We keep the harness scripts, the small result TSVs, and the .ref.json values;
# the large exported models, peer model files, binaries, controllers and logs are
# reproducible and too big to track.

# exported ARCH abstractions + Storm DRNs (tens-to-hundreds of MB each)
arch/models/

# per-benchmark run artifacts (binaries, controller.h5, copied .imdp, logs, dumps)
# -- but keep the small *.tsv summaries that live directly in arch/run/
arch/run/*/

# generated peer model files for the small crosstool models
models/*.drn
models/*.pm
peers/*.drn
run_peers/*.pm
run_peers/*.json
